# Floor invariant 13 of 16 (spec/floor-v2.md §4). Layer: floor.
# Statement carries the floor prose verbatim.
"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/invariant-13-state"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/Invariant"
label: "State: one storage truth through the kernel"
layer: "floor"
statement: >
  State: one storage truth through the kernel; records are immutable, created by
  conditional write; pointers move by CAS; every projection is rebuildable from
  records; reads are fenced; an integrity failure is never translated to absence.
